{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>Send, gather.</b> The wonder is והעז, or 'gather,' and like it is יושבי הגבים העיזו (Isaiah 10:31)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {0 "The phrase הנס או אסוף is cryptic; translated hyper-literally. The quoted form והעז appears to combine vav + עז in the sense of 'gather/strengthen,' but the construction is unusual and may reflect a textual difficulty."}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:32:57.670476937Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}